The <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1utils_1_1double__list_1ab19a62873a09745075bdceb60096c03c" kindref="member">clear()</ref></computeroutput> method initialises the mandatory internal links node so that both its <computeroutput>previous_</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>next_</computeroutput> pointers refer to itself. This marks the list as empty and ensures it is in a safe, known state, ready for new insertions. This operation is typically used to reset the list, removing all elements and breaking any existing links. </para>
